# expect: registry line 8: range on unique column 'id'
# The declared key RANGE arm of the seal has no registry surface: range refuses on a unique
# column, so no keyed rel can carry declared bounds today. The arm itself is pinned by the
# validate_target unit tests; this fixture pins that the world refuses rather than loading a
# rel whose key range was silently dropped.
n 3
unique id nat 10 20 30
range id 10 30
col hp num 1 2 3
rel id mentor 10 20 20
